flowchart LR
  O["AGENTIC · AI AGENT ORCHESTRATOR<br/>Chooses permitted operations, calls tools and bounded agents, and records receipts.<br/>Cannot approve clinical facts or publish accepted state."]

  subgraph L["PRIVATE SOURCE PROCESSING"]
    A["DETERMINISTIC · PRIVATE INTAKE<br/>Isolates the case, inventories pages, preserves the original and records hashes."]
    B["LOCAL MODEL · APPLE VISION OCR<br/>Reads text, confidence and word positions locally; the PDF remains pixel truth."]
    C["DETERMINISTIC · STRUCTURE + DE-IDENTIFICATION<br/>Rebuilds table fields and removes identifiers without changing source geometry."]
    D["HYBRID · SOURCE REVIEW<br/>Terra reads privacy-screened crops; exact consensus closes fields, disagreement reopens review."]
    A --> B --> C --> D
    D -. targeted correction .-> C
  end

  subgraph S["CANONICAL STATE + DETERMINISTIC CONTROL"]
    E["STATE · ACCEPTED EVIDENCE LEDGER<br/>Canonical measurements, dates, findings and provenance; agents can only read it."]
    I["DETERMINISTIC · PROJECTION + DOM CLOSURE<br/>Builds every view and blocks review if any rendered field differs from its source."]
    V["PRIMARY PUBLIC OUTPUT · HEMATOBOARD DASHBOARD<br/>Shows accepted state and a separate candidate across overview, timeline and graph.<br/>Read-only: it never writes clinical state."]
    K["STATE · ACCEPTED REVISION<br/>Stores approved changes as a new hash-pinned state; dependent reasoning becomes stale."]
    I -->|publish view| V
  end

  subgraph R["AGENTIC REASONING + EVIDENCE"]
    X["SOURCE · EXTERNAL EVIDENCE<br/>Finds literature and guidance for narrow questions with version, location, licence and scope."]
    F["HYBRID · EVIDENCE REVIEW<br/>Checks what the source states and whether it applies; a search hit alone is not evidence."]
    G["AGENTIC · CONTROLLED AI AGENT SYNTHESIS<br/>Builds and challenges a candidate argument from accepted facts and reviewed evidence."]
    H["STATE · IMMUTABLE CANDIDATE<br/>Write-once hypotheses, evidence links, gaps and next questions; never overwrites the ledger."]
    X --> F --> G --> H
    H -. new evidence question .-> F
  end

  subgraph U["PRESENTATION + CLINICIAN REVIEW"]
    W["SURFACE · CLINICIAN REVIEW APP<br/>Opens source-linked candidate changes and records review actions."]
    J["HUMAN · CLINICIAN DECISION<br/>Only the responsible clinician can accept, correct, reject or defer changes."]
    N["STATE · DEFER / REJECT<br/>Preserves candidate and rationale for audit without changing accepted state."]
    W --> J
    J -->|defer or reject| N
  end

  P["DETERMINISTIC · APPEND-ONLY RECEIPT PLANE<br/>Records hashes, privacy checks, agent results, tool actions and time; history is never rewritten."]

  D --> E
  E --> G
  H --> I
  I -->|open review| W
  J -->|accept or correct| K
  K -. new hash-pinned cycle .-> E

